Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py smallbitvec, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A bit vector optimized for size and inline storage

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/smallbitvec/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/smallbitvec/ unchanged.

Crates:
  smallbitvec 2.6.1 third_party/smallbitvec/smallbitvec
